title: "Sublogarithmic shares for weakly private near-unanimous reconstruction"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "Constructs one-bit (n-1)-out-of-n secret sharing with perfect reconstruction, pointwise weak privacy, and O(log log n) share size. The privacy ratio can approach one, but perfect privacy is not claimed; includes a near-perfect converse."
